# Atlas Assessment — environment variables.
#
# Copy to .env.local for development:
#   cp .env.example .env.local
# Then fill in the values (see comments). Never commit .env.local.
#
# In production, set these in Vercel project settings (separate values
# per environment per architecture.md decision #4).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Supabase
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Public — exposed to browser bundles. Safe to ship.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54321
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# Server-only. Bypasses RLS. Used by admin and job code (e.g., serving
# questions one-at-a-time per compliance.md §8). NEVER expose to the
# browser. Do not import from any client component.
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Anthropic (uncomment when wiring up the engine — architecture.md #3)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Resend (uncomment when wiring up email — architecture.md #9)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# RESEND_API_KEY=
